:"REST APIs","target":"c_RESTAPI","line":26},{"title":"Interact with the public REST API on a ServiceNow instance","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/developer-guides/mobsdk-ios-interact-rest_api.md","line":26},{"title":"NowGraphQLService","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/cllent-mobile-api-reference/NowGraphQLServiceiOSAPI.md","line":30},{"title":"Combine","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/combine","line":44},{"title":"NowTableService","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/cllent-mobile-api-reference/NowTableServiceiOSAPI.md","line":123},{"title":"Combine","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/combine","line":127},{"title":"insert","target":"r_Insert","line":129},{"title":"update","target":"r_Update","line":145},{"title":"NowTableService class - iOS","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/cllent-mobile-api-reference/NowTableServiceiOSAPI.md","line":170},{"title":"REST APIs","target":"c_RESTAPI","line":174},{"title":"Table API","target":"c_TableAPI","line":175},{"title":"insert","target":"r_Insert","line":176},{"title":"update","target":"r_Update","line":177}],"metadata":{"title":"Interact with table data in a ServiceNow instance","description":"The Mobile SDK enables you to interact with data in tables that reside on your ServiceNow instance. You can interact with this data through the ServiceNow REST Table API using the NowTableService\\(\\) API that directly calls the REST interface, or through the NowGraphQLService\\(\\) API that executes a specified GraphQL query against the REST GraphQL API.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/developer-guides/mobsdk-ios-interact\\_data\\_instance.html","release":"australia","product":"De